# Written into snippet projects by bynkc: `test` emits out/ and out-js/, and
# `compile` writes a bynk.schema.lock (empty here, as no snippet declares an
# event). None of it is printed in the book.
snippets/**/out/
snippets/**/out-js/
snippets/**/bynk.schema.lock
# Chapter 13's step 6 is about the schema registry, so its locks are evidence:
# each records the event history that project's build is checked against.
!snippets/chapter-13/step-6-*/bynk.schema.lock

